+    "findings": "<p>The Annex combines size and shape measurement with polymer identification by vibrational microspectroscopy. Mass-only thermal analysis does not by itself supply particle counts, sizes or shapes.</p><p>The supplied decision adopts the Annex methodology and addresses it to Member States. Its recitals distinguish techniques that can characterize individual objects from thermal techniques that quantify polymer mass. They also explain the need for representative sampling, workable monitoring procedures and consistent reporting. The decision concerns how to obtain and describe measurements within its water scope; it is not a report of concentrations found in a set of consumer products. <a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dec_del/2024/1441/oj/eng\">Source: PDF pp. 2-3, recitals 7-14 and Articles 1-2</a>.</p><p>The Annex combines collection, contamination control and recovery evaluation. Collection filters retain material for analysis, while procedural blanks follow corresponding preparation steps to assess contamination from equipment, reagents and the surrounding atmosphere. Recovery checks use identifiable added particles to examine the implemented procedure. These checks address different sources of measurement error. A blank does not measure recovery, and a recovery check does not establish that background contamination is absent. <a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dec_del/2024/1441/oj/eng\">Source: PDF pp. 5-6, Annex section 2, points 1-8</a>.</p><p>Particle identification is based on comparison with reference spectra, alongside information about size and shape. The reporting provisions retain the sampled volume, location and time, treatment, analytical instrument, subsampling and deviations from the method. Those details are necessary to understand a reported result. This record describes the supplied analytical instrument and its requirements, without converting it into a food-packaging release test, a clinical diagnostic method or a health-based concentration ceiling. <a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dec_del/2024/1441/oj/eng\">Source: PDF p. 7, Annex section 2, points 10-17</a>.</p>",
